{
  "schemaVersion": "1.1.0",
  "id": "alerting-first-rule-configure-labels-evaluation",
  "title": "Create a folder and add labels",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "You'll organize your alert into a folder and add labels that control how notifications get routed.\n\nFolders organize alerts by team, service, or purpose, and control who can manage them.\n\nIn this milestone, you create a folder, then add rule-level labels."
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "id": "select-folder",
      "title": "Create a folder",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "multistep",
          "content": "Click **New folder**, name it **QuickPizza alerts**, then click **Create**.",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/alerting/new/alerting"
          ],
          "steps": [
            {
              "action": "button",
              "reftarget": "New folder"
            },
            {
              "action": "formfill",
              "reftarget": "input[data-testid='data-testid alert-rule name-folder-name-field']",
              "targetvalue": "QuickPizza alerts"
            },
            {
              "action": "button",
              "reftarget": "Create"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Grafana selects the new folder after it creates it. Confirm that **QuickPizza alerts** appears in the Folder field, then add labels."
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "id": "add-labels",
      "title": "Add labels",
      "requirements": [
        "section-completed:select-folder"
      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "multistep",
          "content": "Click **Add labels**, set **severity** to **critical**, then click **Save** to route the alert.",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/alerting/new/alerting"
          ],
          "steps": [
            {
              "action": "button",
              "reftarget": "Add labels"
            },
            {
              "action": "formfill",
              "reftarget": "input[data-testid='alertlabel-key-combobox']",
              "targetvalue": "severity"
            },
            {
              "action": "formfill",
              "reftarget": "input[data-testid='alertlabel-value-combobox']",
              "targetvalue": "critical"
            },
            {
              "action": "button",
              "reftarget": "Save"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "[data-testid='data-testid alert-rule step-3']:contains('severity'):contains('critical')",
          "content": "Confirm that **severity=critical** appears on the alert rule.",
          "doIt": false,
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/alerting/new/alerting"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Your alert now has a folder and a label. Next, you set how often the rule evaluates and how long the condition must last before the alert fires."
    }
  ]
}
